## Connections for ESP8266

| OLED | ESP8266 | DESCRIPTIONS |
|------|----------|------------- |
| VCC  | 3.3V     | POWER SUPPLY |
| GND  | GND      | GROUND |
| SDA  | D2 (GPIO4) | I2C DATA |
| SCL  | D1 (GPIO5) |I2C CLOCK |

## Connections For ESP32

| OLED | ESP32 | DESCRIPTIONS |
|------|----------|------------- |
| VCC  | 3.3V     | POWER SUPPLY |
| GND  | GND      | GROUND |
| SDA  | D21 (GPIO21) | I2C DATA |
| SCL  | D22 (GPIO22) |I2C CLOCK |
